The following items in this repository use a license other than MIT:

 * Korean card content (gen/out/*.json, data/content.js, gen/PROMPT.md):
   CC BY-SA 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
   Copyright (c) 2026 VocabFlip contributors.

 * US pronunciations (data/ipa_dict.js, the "ipa" fields of data/deck.js,
   data/phonemes.js): derived from the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary,
   Copyright (C) 1993-2015 Carnegie Mellon University, BSD-style license.
   Full text: licenses/CMUdict-LICENSE.txt

 * Word list (headwords, levels and word-family forms in data/deck.js and
   gen/in/*.json): BNC/COCA word family lists v2.0.0 by Paul Nation,
   as distributed by eapfoundation.com. Copyright remains with the author.

 * Tongue twisters (data/twisters.js): from "1st International Collection of
   Tongue Twisters", https://tongue-twister.net/en.htm, (c) 1996-2018 Mr.Twister.
   Copyright remains with the original authors. Not covered by this repository's
   licenses.

 * Fonts (fonts/ADD-*.woff2): 국방과학연구소체 (ADD Font), converted to WOFF2
   from the files distributed at https://www.add.re.kr. Intellectual property of
   the Agency for Defense Development (국방과학연구소). Selling the font is
   prohibited and distortion of the letterforms (stretching, slanting, outline,
   weight change, patterns) is not recommended. Not covered by this
   repository's licenses.

"Rachel's English" is only linked to (YouTube search and rachelsenglish.com);
no content from it is included.
